{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_03_end","storyGroup":"act49side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act49side_level_act49side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TA-3","storyName":"聚墨痕","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"混乱中，梁洵出面解围，矛盾暂息。陈问及梁洵对魏彦吾失踪一事的看法。商议之后，众人决定前往天镜阁顶楼，调查那柄尘封已久的书刀。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act49side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["左乐","陈","莫佚","陈昭芊","？？？","梁洵","陈昭芊&陈&梁洵","陈昭芊&梁洵","陈昭芊&陈","陈&梁洵&左乐"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_bg_70_g3_tjbookshelf.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"70_g3_tjbookshelf","duration":"0.1","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","xFrom":"80","xTo":"80","isblock":"true","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_loop","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":10,"musicid":0},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"70_g3_tjbookshelf","duration":"0.5","xFrom":"80","xTo":"30","block":"false","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","duration":"0.3","block":"true","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"陈小姐，请将手中之物交还——","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"70_g3_tjbookshelf","duration":"0.5","xFrom":"30","xTo":"-20","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","duration":"0.3","isblock":"true","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"放开人质！","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"70_g3_tjbookshelf","duration":"0.5","xFrom":"-20","xTo":"-70","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#4$1","focus":"all","duration":"0.3","isblock":"false","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","focus":"all","posfrom":"-110,-90","posto":"-110,-90","duration":"0.3","isblock":"false","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","focus":"all","isblock":"true","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"先把木锁还来！","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"各位......我们要不先冷静下来，好好谈谈......","id":27},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"远远就听见了楼下的声响，还以为是某处的伥怪复又暴动。","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不料是三位客人，在此切磋武艺。","id":31},{"type":"dialog","id":32},{"type":"charslot","id":33},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.8","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"梁大人？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"左公子，别来无恙。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":42},{"type":"charslot","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"（左公子......似乎在罗德岛上听到过。）","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"阁中祸乱难靖，梁某正忧心该如何解决......","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#8$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"见到司岁台派左公子前来协理，总算是能安心了。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"我......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......莫非梁某误会了？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"监正大人自有安排，不劳梁大人费心。既然我此刻在此，自当尽力协助。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"那公子缉拿这位面生的小姐，也是监正大人的授意？","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"她叫莫佚......是山海众的一员。数日之前在邙山镇中惹生事端，如今又在伥怪横行之时现身百灶。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"行迹可疑，在下必须彻查。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","focus":"all","posfrom":"-110,-90","posto":"-110,-90","isblock":"false","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","focus":"all","isblock":"true","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"左秉烛还真是不领情......","id":70},{"type":"dialog","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"山海众......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"all","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-20,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"false","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","focus":"all","posfrom":"-110,-90","posto":"-130,-90","duration":"0.5","isblock":"false","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","focus":"all","isblock":"true","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"（挟紧陈昭芊，警惕地后退）","id":81},{"type":"dialog","id":82},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"城中戒严，山海众如果在这里只是为了惹生事端......莫小姐，反倒称得上一句“勇气可嘉”了。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","focus":"all","posfrom":"-110,-90","posto":"-110,-90","isblock":"false","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","focus":"all","isblock":"true","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"哈，你看上去比这位秉烛人还要木讷一点，没想到还算明事理。","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"那能不能麻烦你和这位左公子说说，让他先不要一门心思和我过不去。","id":93},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"梁某人微言轻，只能恳请莫小姐放开这位......在下的同僚。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"“遍览山川湖泽，穷究自然物理”，这是千年前山海众最初的信条。至于伤及无辜，应当也不是莫小姐的本意。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"梁大人？","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"charslot","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"all","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","focus":"all","posfrom":"-110,-90","posto":"-110,-90","isblock":"false","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","focus":"all","isblock":"true","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"你怎么会知道这些事......","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"......哼。","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drawsword","id":110},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_exsheath","delay":"0.5","id":111},{"type":"text","text":"片刻沉默之后，莫佚还刃入鞘，又将身前的典水官轻轻向前推了推。","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","posfrom":"-130,-90","posto":"-90,-90","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":114},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement_heavy2","volume":"1","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","isblock":"false","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","posfrom":"-80,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.3","isblock":"true","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"你没事？","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"无碍......","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#2$1","focus":"l","text":"","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"新来的誊录郎，多谢了。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/74/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"r","isblock":"false","id":128},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"嗯......","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"如果在下没认错这柄剑的话......","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"陈小姐在此时回到百灶，的确是出人意料。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"玉门参知，梁洵，梁大人。前番在玉门，我在魏彦吾身旁见过你。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"大人身居要职，“人微言轻”四字，未免过谦。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"梁某如今只是这天镜阁中一名再普通不过的誊录郎。陈小姐远道而来，尚不知晓梁某去职之事，亦属常情。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"（目光锁定左乐手中的木锁）","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"charslot","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#12$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#12$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.3","isblock":"true","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"还敢妄动！","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"啧，那个信物暂且不论，这木锁本就是我的东西！","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......那又如何。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"你？！","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"交代清楚你的来意，我会视情况处置这枚木锁。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"......说了你也不信。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"老天师究竟为何会放你来百灶？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"啧......","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"她老人家发了话，战事在即，城中混乱，难免有人争功逞能，趁机生事......“那个秉烛人小孩此趟回城，怕是会遇上不少阻碍。”","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#12$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"她既带走了麟少卿和云先生，于情于理，都该帮左秉烛再寻个帮手——","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#12$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"“若是看到有人阻挠那小子执行公务，你便尽可能从旁关照关照。”","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"不然，你以为我会愿意，来帮你这个榆木脑袋？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......那这木锁是？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"......","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"还要隐瞒？！","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"......是娘亲留下的遗物。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#4$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"-150,0","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#13$2","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"150,0","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊&陈&梁洵","text":"......","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"charslot","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"（怔住）","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"现下我人也放了，娘亲的遗物也在你手里，你到底还想怎么样？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"这......即便有前辈的交代，你还是须随我走一趟司岁台，将先前诸事交代明白。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"只要你别再惹是生非，等事情结束，我保证这木锁完好无损地回到你手里。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"你无非是想把木锁留在自己手里挟制我，是也不是？","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"我都说了，现在的司岁台——","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"诸位，既然误会已经解开，那能否暂时罢手，先将当下局面厘清？","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"charslot","id":217},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_bg_70_g3_tjbookshelf.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":219},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"animtext","id":221,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>望日前两日 午时</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":222},{"type":"animtextclean","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_loop","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":225,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"梁大人，你一直在天镜阁，那你是否清楚，这些凭空出现的甲士，到底是什么？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"关于此事，还是让左公子来解释吧。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"charslot","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"它们是“伥物”。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"据司岁台研究，部分巨兽拥有使死物化形的权能。图画，器具，文字......都在此列。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"如今出现在百灶城中的伥物，或许是借由天镜阁中史书所记载的，大狩猎时期的炎国军队形象现身。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"此刻出现，应是与岁陵中的异动有关。至于它们为何时隐时现，我也不知——","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"那是巨兽的呼吸吐纳。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#12$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"“生物之以息相吹”，如今这些伥物出现的频率越来越高，那恰恰说明——祂的梦快要醒了。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"你为何会知道？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"都说了，要论起巨兽研究，你们才是后来者。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"那这字伥的源头，为何会是天镜阁？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"在下于巨兽之学所知并不算精通，关于天镜阁，在下只是有一个猜想......","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"梁大人！......慎言。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"够了，都已经是什么时候了，你还要死守着你那一套规矩？","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"我没有打算刺探司岁台秘辛，但眼下事态紧急，我们有必要共享情报。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......因为这里，存放着那位消失的代理人，留在这世上的最后一件东西。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"一柄书刀。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"书刀？","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"难道是，从来不曾开启的天镜阁顶楼......？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"这柄书刀十分特殊。那位代理人身殒之后，她曾倾注心血，或是朝夕相伴的东西，几乎全都随之消失。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......但唯独剩下了这柄书刀。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","text":"","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"如今城中作乱的伥物是由文字所化，的确很有可能，与这柄书刀有关。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#3$1","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊&梁洵","text":"......","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"charslot","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#10$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......这就说得通了。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":299},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"梁大人的意思是？","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"前些时日，兵部的人隔三差五便无故到天镜阁来搜查一番。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"但天镜阁的事务一向归礼部管，因为这事，梁大人已向肃政院递交过多份检举文书。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"这两日，他们才稍微消停了些。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"charslot","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"兵部？","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"方才在主街，便有一列巡防营的人试图拦我......","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","focus":"l","text":"","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"梁大人，难道......是太尉那边的动作？","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"charslot","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"你怎么不说，那群巡防营的人就跟在你们司岁台的秉烛人身后？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","focus":"l","text":"","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"你！","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"哈，只是猜测。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"我可没说司岁台就和太尉一伙有什么见不得人的勾当。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","focus":"l","text":"","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"“朋党倾轧”四字，从来都不在司岁台眼中。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"嚯，我还从未听闻，身处这百灶朝堂上的高官贵胄，当真会有不搅和进“朋党倾轧”的。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"charslot","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......待我回禀监正大人，自会查明！","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"猜测而已，左公子倒不必这么激动。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"......即便如此，兵部为何要找寻这柄书刀？","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"除了与字伥有关，书刀还有什么用途？","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"寻常书刀是古时在竹简上删削之器，而这位代理人的东西究竟有何等威能......在下不知。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"左公子，应该知道些细节吧？快说啊。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"......","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"这位代理人生前，一直在协助炎国编撰史书，她的权能也十分特殊。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"司岁台卷宗载——“其笔，际究天人；其刀，变通古今。”","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"这柄书刀，似乎可以删改某些......不可轻触之物。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"一个人的名字，一个人的存在，甚至是......一整段历史的存在。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":381},{"type":"charslot","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#4$1","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#15$2","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊&陈","text":"......","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":386},{"type":"charslot","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#4$1","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"开什么玩笑......历史怎么可能说改就改？","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"怎样才算改了历史？是改掉所有人的记忆？还是说一句话就能抹除许多人的存在？","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":392},{"type":"charslot","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"巨兽的权能远远超出我们的常识......不可以常理推测。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"只是根据司岁台的研究，这柄书刀，的确做到过诸如此类的事。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"charslot","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"看来左公子也不完全知情。","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"但是想要拿到书刀的别有用心之人，应当是清楚该如何使用的。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"什么......","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"可恶......说了这么多，我们现在到底该怎么办？","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"是要防止它落入别有用心的人手中，还是借助它的力量阻止城中的伥乱？","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"charslot","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"据我所知，这柄书刀早在许多年前就藏置在天镜阁顶楼。司岁台也为其添加了重重封印。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"要打开封印需要两把钥匙，监正大人与那位排行第四的代理人各自持有一把。如果没有她们二人同时在场，绝无可能打开封印。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"......或者说，可以用到你从界园带出来的那个东西？","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"要不我们试试呢？","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"——？！","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"绝对不可！","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"我们对书刀的威能还不了解，对从界园带出来的这个物件更几乎一无所知，怎么可以轻举妄动——","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"好啊，这也不行那也不行，那我们就坐等岁兽醒来，和整座百灶城同归于尽咯。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":430},{"type":"charslot","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"......","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"从刚才起陈小姐便一言不发，可是还有疑虑？","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"陈晖洁，你到底在想什么？","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":438},{"type":"charslot","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"......我想请梁大人明示，你所说的别有用心之人，究竟指谁？","id":441,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"梁某斗胆猜测，陈小姐此番入城，应是奉魏公之命，处理些私事吧？","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"......","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"魏公此刻在何处？","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"他失踪了。","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#4$1","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":452},{"type":"charslot","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"失踪？！","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"魏公武艺高强，常人岂能动他？","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":458},{"type":"charslot","id":459},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#4$1","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"陈小姐入城，莫非是怀疑......魏公如今已在城中？","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2128_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈昭芊","text":"简直是胡闹！以他的身份擅自入京，就不怕有人弹劾他“心存异心”吗？","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2128_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":464},{"type":"charslot","id":465},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","posfrom":"-120,0","posto":"-120,0","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#2$1","id":467},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"150,0","block":"true","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈&梁洵&左乐","text":"......","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":470},{"type":"charslot","id":471},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#11$1","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"哈哈，妙极了，这里也有那些大人物们的腌臜事。","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":474},{"type":"charslot","id":475},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"梁大人，事态紧急，不必再讲套话。","id":477,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"在你看来，书刀，巡防营，司岁台......兵部的种种异常举动，与魏彦吾的失踪是否存在关联？","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#2$1","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"梁某不敢妄言。只是，魏公失踪之前，这些异动的确还没有现在这么明目张胆。","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"但就我所知，魏公和陛下的性格的确相反。魏公果决，有时不免鲁莽，而陛下稳重，在某些人眼里可能就是寡断。","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"既然这样，是不是太尉一党拿住了魏彦吾的什么把柄，裹挟他进城，借助那柄“能删改历史”的书刀，行那......","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"不，魏彦吾那副臭脾气，谁拿住他的把柄，他只会百倍奉还。","id":487,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"难道是他主动......？！","id":489,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1050_chen3_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈","text":"不，他回百灶毕竟是真龙的旨意，除非他临时变卦......可如果是真龙召见，他又何苦避着别人？","id":491,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_1050_chen3_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"......","id":493,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#1$1","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"人心难测，魏公之心更难揣度。若是陈小姐真替他担忧，不如先从这天镜阁内入手，查清书刀来由，以不变应万变，如何？","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#6$1","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"以不变应万变，说得好。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1871_1#6$1","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫佚","text":"请问梁大人，我们要查清书刀究竟能用来做什么，乃至保护书刀，应该往何处去？","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_1871_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#7$1","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"各位应该——","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":502},{"type":"charslot","id":503},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","posfrom":"-80,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":504},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"（小声）梁大人，她——","id":506,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#8$1","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"向上攀登便是。","id":508,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_295_1#8$1","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梁洵","text":"天镜阁越往上，所藏的书卷便越稀有珍贵，善加利用，想必大有裨益。","id":510,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_295_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":511},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":512},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":513},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":514},{"type":"charslot","id":515},{"type":"background","id":516},{"type":"image","id":517}],"characters":["左乐","陈","莫佚","陈昭芊","？？？","梁洵","陈昭芊&陈&梁洵","陈昭芊&梁洵","陈昭芊&陈","陈&梁洵&左乐"]}